### Register a new device
POST http://localhost:5050/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_model": "Samsung S22",
  "os": "Android 15",
  "app_version": "1.0",
  "consent_given": true
}

### Ingest a network metric
POST http://localhost:5050/api/metrics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "anonymous_id": "1d629c65-4f30-4680-b983-34afeaf40d64",
  "network_type": "4G LTE",
  "operator_name": "MTN",
  "signal_strength_dbm": -75,
  "download_mbps": 34.5,
  "upload_mbps": 12.1,
  "latency_ms": 23.8,
  "jitter_ms": 4.2,
  "packet_loss_pct": 0.0
}

### Track a location
POST http://localhost:5050/api/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "anonymous_id": "1d629c65-4f30-4680-b983-34afeaf40d64",
  "latitude": 5.123456,
  "longitude": 9.123456,
  "location_name": "Buea Highway"
}

### Submit feedback
POST http://localhost:5050/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "anonymous_id": "<replace-with-device-id>",
  "metric_id": null,
  "overall_rating": 4,
  "speed_rating": 4,
  "delay_rating": 3,
  "reliability_rating": 5,
  "comment": "Good coverage and stable speed"
}

### Get average speed for a device
GET http://localhost:5050/api/analytics/average-speed/1d629c65-4f30-4680-b983-34afeaf40d64

### Get average QoE for a device
GET http://localhost:5050/api/analytics/average-qoe/1d629c65-4f30-4680-b983-34afeaf40d64

### Get latest metric for a device
GET http://localhost:5050/api/analytics/latest-metric/1d629c65-4f30-4680-b983-34afeaf40d64

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### OPERATOR DATA EXPORT ENDPOINTS
### Requires Authorization header with valid operator API key
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. List all configured operators
GET http://localhost:5000/api/export/operators
Authorization: Bearer mtn_api_key_demo_abc123

### 2. Export single device as JSON (MTN operator)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/export/device/1d629c65-4f30-4680-b983-34afeaf40d64?format=json
Authorization: Bearer mtn_api_key_demo_abc123

### 3. Export single device as CSV (MTN operator)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/export/device/1d629c65-4f30-4680-b983-34afeaf40d64?format=csv
Authorization: Bearer mtn_api_key_demo_abc123

### 4. Export ALL devices for MTN as JSON
GET http://localhost:5050/api/export/all?format=json
Authorization: Bearer mtn_api_key_demo_abc123

### 5. Export ALL devices for MTN as CSV (bulk download)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/export/all?format=csv
Authorization: Bearer mtn_api_key_demo_abc123

### 6. Orange operator tries to access MTN device — should return 404 (no data)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/export/device/1d629c65-4f30-4680-b983-34afeaf40d64?format=json
Authorization: Bearer orange_api_key_demo_def456

### 7. Unauthorized request (no API key) — should return 401
GET http://localhost:5050/api/export/device/1d629c65-4f30-4680-b983-34afeaf40d64?format=json

### 8. Invalid API key — should return 403
GET http://localhost:5050/api/export/all?format=json
Authorization: Bearer fake_invalid_key_xxx